## What the root LICENSE covers

The root LICENSE (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 powerycy) covers only the code written
in this repository — the Skill layer and the glue code of the integrations.
The ports under `integrations/` are derivative works of the upstream Jev Chat
assistant and each carries its own LICENSE and attribution files. They are
**not** covered by the root LICENSE.

Written in this repository: `SKILL.md`, `agents/`, `references/`, `examples/`,
`scripts/`, `tests/`, `GLOSSARY.md`, `docs/`.

